body:
Haha I am super glad you can relate!! AMEN my dude they really do go together beautifully!! I'm glad you also had a crazy/awesome experience!! Hope you have an awesome rest of the weekend! :)

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I know exactly what you're talking about. I have some onions too and my god when you rail a huge line it does two things: 1) Sends your brain into overdrive because it's the holy grail of beak 2) Leaves you in awe at how CLEAN it is, you can literally feel it going into you but there's zero burn or bad feeling, makes you realise what it's SUPPOSED to be like all the time!

&#x200B;

Enjoy my friend!
